<h2><span class=3D"mw-headline" id=3D"Specialization_Training">Specializati=
on Training</span></h2>
<p>To specialize in a specific slider you will need to be level 7 and meet =
required levels of design and technology. This can also serve as a guide fo=
r which employees to use for each slider (the Design/Tech requirements for =
specialization are proportional to the Design/Tech components of each Dev f=
ocus). Great games need employees focused on either design or technology, a=
s well as employees with a good balance of both. Save your well balanced em=
ployees for Stage #3. Specialization costs 200 research points and 5M credi=
ts per person.
</p>
